Package: jewbuntu-lubuntu-lxde
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jewbuntu Developers <maintainers@jewbuntu.invalid>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: lxpanel, pcmanfm, lynx
Recommends: shulgo-xfce, pulseaudio-utils
Homepage: https://jewbuntu.com
Description: Jewbuntu skin for Lubuntu 18.04 (LXDE, 32-bit and 64-bit)
 A light Jewbuntu skin over Lubuntu 18.04's LXDE desktop, the last Ubuntu
 flavour for 32-bit PCs. Lubuntu itself is not changed. This adds:
  - a Star of David as the start-menu button on the panel
  - the blue Star of David wallpaper on the desktop and the login screen
    (in place of Lubuntu's default picture; a wallpaper you chose is kept)
  - Jewbuntu's short startup jingle at sign-in, once per boot
  - ShulGo's minyan widget in the panel (recommended package shulgo-xfce)
  - Lynx, a light text web browser, in the menu (Firefox stays)
